    I -- Yes --> K[Agent B turn\nGemini 3.5 Flash]
    K --> E
    C --> L[TTS\nbrowser speechSynthesis — both agents\n$0 · no API key]
    C --> M[Live captions / transcript\nPRIMARY UI — always on\nif audio fails this is sufficient]
